Subject: Question about the appropriate model fit for comparing species among different clades
Message-ID: <hEfCWwGzq5E.KjR8jio5BAAJ@geomorph-r-package.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/geomorph-r-package/c/hEfCWwGzq5E/m/KjR8jio5BAAJ>
